    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an odyssey beyond the stars in &quot;Further,&quot; a spellbinding virtual reality adventure that defies the limits of space and imagination. Assume the role of Alex, a fearless protagonist thrust into an solar asteroid mining realm of trials\u00a0 and encounters with extraterrestrial entities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive VR gameplay blending tests, stealth, and FPS battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a solo indie developer, this game is a labor of love created with passion and care. While every effort has been made to provide a great experience, your feedback is invaluable to help refine and improve the game 'further'. Thank you for supporting indie games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an odyssey beyond the stars in &quot;Further,&quot; a spellbinding virtual reality adventure that defies the limits of space and imagination. Assume the role of Alex, a fearless protagonist thrust into an solar asteroid mining realm of trials\u00a0 and encounters with extraterrestrial entities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive VR gameplay blending tests, stealth, and FPS battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a solo indie developer, this game is a labor of love created with passion and care. While every effort has been made to provide a great experience, your feedback is invaluable to help refine and improve the game 'further'. Thank you for supporting indie games.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an odyssey beyond the stars in &quot;Further,&quot; a spellbinding virtual reality adventure that defies the limits of space and imagination. Assume the role of Alex, a fearless protagonist thrust into an interstellar realm of trials, puzzles, and encounters with extraterrestrial entities.",
